{"c":[{"name":"20261021T160004Z-0474312fdfee4cb0","text":"Every stockroom release must stand alone: users skip releases. Releases v0.1.0-v2.1.2 all pinned DuckDB 1.5.4, so warehouses in the wild are v1.0.0+ at schema 1-8. Under DuckDB 2.0, tests that need an old-format file must create it at storage v1.0.0 on purpose.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T161737Z-639a1a68a7083e6a","text":"Measured 2026-10-21: DuckDB 1.5.4 opens (ro and rw) a v1.0.0+ file a crashed DuckDB 2.0.0 writer left with a wal, plain or vss HNSW-indexed, and replays all rows; the wal matches a 1.5.4 writer's in size. Only files 2.0 creates (v2.0.0+) are unreadable before 2.0.","type":"note"}]}
